      "canonicalConceptId": "concept:885850da4e18cc213a7616242dbbe79b6a12d116061b0323df6f4c062a7bc8f7",
      "text": "CDC replay lets a case-alerting consumer resume from a durable cursor within Salesforce\u2019s documented retention window. Recovery also requires record reconciliation: gap events omit record data, overflow events require broader repair, and expired cursors cannot restore purged history. A current-state rebuild and a controlled return to streaming are distinct from recovering every historical alert. Rare stream resets and persistence failures further limit replay guarantees.",
